flowchart TD
    A([Schedule Trigger]) --> B[Get row in sheet<br/>status=pending]
    B --> C{HTTP - JEV Choice<br/>classify question type}
    C -- account/policy/how_to --> P1[Qdrant retrieve top-k=5]
    C -- other --> Z[Slack #human-review<br/>type unclear]
    P1 --> D[Gemini 2.5 Pro<br/>draft reply from chunks]
    D --> E{HTTP - JEV Score<br/>grounding 0-10}
    D --> F{HTTP - JEV Noul<br/>answer grounded in chunks?}
    E -- score>=7 --> G[Update row<br/>status=answered]
    E -- score<7 --> H[Slack #human-review<br/>+ chunks attached]
    F -- choice=yes --> G
    F -- choice=no --> H
